  "rationale": "Column names a02-a09 are given in the GSM descriptions. HCT-116 Brunello KO library (a02, collection of mutants before selection) co-cultured with KHYG-1 NK cells; survivors sequenced after round 1 (a03) and after a second challenge of the round-1 survivors (a07). The paper reads guides enriched in survivors (resistance to NK killing), so the main contrast is KHYG-1 round 1 vs the pre-selection collection; round 2 vs collection is the cumulative selection the paper also shows; KHYG-1 vs NKp44-KO KHYG-1 (round 1) isolates NKp44-dependent resistance (ICAM1). One library per condition: no residual df, so run_barcs.R uses the no-replicate path and calls are screening-level.",
